      "videoCount": 50,
      "subscriberCount": 18900,
      "description": "Every level of every career, rank, and hierarchy - explained with real salaries, real numbers, and real insider knowledge. Ladder Theory breaks down the world's most competitive progressions using cinematic illustrated storytelling. How much do surgeons make? What does a CIA operative actually earn? How do you climb from intern to chief, recruit to commander, amateur to champion? Every video covers real compensation at every stage, insider jargon, promotion gates, and the hidden cost of advancement nobody warns you about. This is what each level actually looks like when you are standing in it - specific numbers, specific titles, specific moments insiders recognize immediately.\n\n⚠️ Not financial or career advice. All figures are for educational purposes only and individual outcomes vary.\n\n🔔 Subscribe if you've ever wondered what it actually takes to reach the top.\n",
      "channelId": "UCinYID7jUm-hwa7evnLixjQ",
      "metadataFetchedAt": "2026-06-16T17:14:51.464Z"
    },
